       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added the E3 1998 Demo to the Bonus Material section.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated Nosgoth Lore with new locations and improved descriptions.",
