       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Corrected Lore Reader locations for accuracy.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a crash when switching to the \"Corrupted\" tab in the Lore menu while using Russian language settings.: Soul Reaver",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where Raziel could start floating after shifting into the Material Realm while in water and jumping immediately after.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved visuals for enemy corpses in HD mode to better match the original version.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a crash caused by saving behind geometry and attempting to reload.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ariel's scream during a vision sequence now plays only once, as intended.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue with Dumah’s eyes not displaying correctly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Restored missing sound effects before and after visions, similar to the original PS1 version.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a crash when using telekinesis in a specific area of the Human Citadel.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Health capacity activity now correctly displays 100% completion.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a crash when repeatedly viewing Chronoplast Visions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Soul Reaver 2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where the Thrall NPC’s lower body would disappear in mirror light effects in HD mode.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted timing so that subtitles during Raziel’s monologue no longer disappear too early.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed subtitles disappearing too early during a dialogue scene with Ariel.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved distant texture rendering in underwater areas.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved an issue where textures displayed as \"noise\" instead of proper visuals in HD mode.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Localizations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The \"Hold to Skip\" prompt now displays correctly in all languages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The \"Exit to Launcher\" text now displays correctly in all languages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added Portuguese language support.: General",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Completed activity progress now properly carries over when starting a new game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where stacked cubes could become stuck together when pushed.",
